  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="00:00.289" end="00:01.789" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You have no heart)</p>
      <p begin="00:00.641" end="00:03.558" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, why you toying with my ****ing brain? Woah</p>
      <p begin="00:03.558" end="00:07.012" ttm:agent="v1">All these other girls, are not the same, woah</p>
      <p begin="00:07.012" end="00:09.282" ttm:agent="v1">All these women borin' me</p>
      <p begin="00:09.282" end="00:12.587" ttm:agent="v1">They can't love you like I do, why are you ignoring me? Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:12.587" end="00:14.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Silo killed this shit)</p>
      <p begin="00:14.095" end="00:15.595" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:15.186" end="00:16.686" ttm:agent="v1">[Post-Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="00:15.373" end="00:16.873" ttm:agent="v1">I might spend my racks now</p>
      <p begin="00:16.558" end="00:18.058" ttm:agent="v1">Just to fill the void, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:18.053" end="00:19.553" ttm:agent="v1">Everybody's watching</p>
      <p begin="00:19.412" end="00:21.087" ttm:agent="v1">Gas got me exhausted</p>
      <p begin="00:21.087" end="00:22.587" ttm:agent="v1">Thought I had your heart</p>
      <p begin="00:22.484" end="00:24.716" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But I guess I really lost it (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:24.716" end="00:26.216" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse]</p>
      <p begin="00:24.954" end="00:26.659" ttm:agent="v1">I be in that brand new Benz</p>
      <p begin="00:26.659" end="00:28.235" ttm:agent="v1">I be high like Peter Pan</p>
      <p begin="00:28.235" end="00:29.891" ttm:agent="v1">She said since I'm on her playlist</p>
      <p begin="00:29.891" end="00:31.391" ttm:agent="v1">Thought she might just bring a friend</p>
      <p begin="00:31.368" end="00:33.000" ttm:agent="v1">Only hear my money countin</p>
      <p begin="00:33.000" end="00:34.716" ttm:agent="v1">Don't really care about your comments</p>
      <p begin="00:34.716" end="00:36.216" ttm:agent="v1">Got a problem with my clique?</p>
      <p begin="00:36.195" end="00:37.695" ttm:agent="v1">Then best believe that we gon' solve it</p>
      <p begin="00:37.662" end="00:39.162" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:37.883" end="00:39.383" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="00:38.045" end="00:41.928" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, why you toying with my ****ing brain? Woah</p>
      <p begin="00:41.928" end="00:45.450" ttm:agent="v1">All these other girls are not the same, woah</p>
      <p begin="00:45.450" end="00:47.345" ttm:agent="v1">All these women borin' me</p>
      <p begin="00:47.345" end="00:48.845" ttm:agent="v1">They can't love you like I do, why are you ignoring me? Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:48.553" end="00:51.110" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:51.110" end="00:52.610" ttm:agent="v1">[Post-Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="00:52.198" end="00:54.397" ttm:agent="v1">I might spend my racks now</p>
      <p begin="00:54.397" end="00:55.897" ttm:agent="v1">Just to fill the void, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:55.896" end="00:57.510" ttm:agent="v1">Everybody's watching</p>
      <p begin="00:57.510" end="00:59.036" ttm:agent="v1">Gas got me exhausted</p>
      <p begin="00:59.036" end="01:00.586" ttm:agent="v1">Thought I had your heart</p>
      <p begin="01:00.586" end="01:02.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But I guess I really lost it (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.159" end="01:03.659" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:02.565" end="01:04.065" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="01:03.222" end="01:07.172" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, why you toying with my ****ing brain? Woah</p>
      <p begin="01:07.172" end="01:10.827" ttm:agent="v1">All these other girls are not the same, woah</p>
      <p begin="01:10.827" end="01:12.426" ttm:agent="v1">All these women bore me</p>
      <p begin="01:12.426" end="01:15.973" ttm:agent="v1">They can't love you like I do, why are you ignoring me? Yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:15.973" end="01:19.861" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, why you toying with my ****ing brain? Woah</p>
      <p begin="01:19.861" end="01:23.318" ttm:agent="v1">All these other girls are not the same, woah</p>
      <p begin="01:23.318" end="01:25.175" ttm:agent="v1">All these women bore me</p>
